      },
      "example": "这里不可以拍照。",
      "exampleTranslations": {
        "my": "ဒီနေရာမှာ ဓာတ်ပုံရိုက်လို့ မရပါဘူး။",
        "en": "You cannot take photos here."
      },
      "audio": "audio/words/greeting_005.mp3",
      "level": "A1",
      "phonetic_my": "ပု ခယ် ယီ",
      "example_pinyin": "Zhèlǐ bù kěyǐ pāizhào.",
      "usage_scene": "拒绝、禁止、说明规则",
      "notes": "比“不行”更完整，适合说明规定。",
      "synonyms": [
        "不行",
        "不能"
      ],
      "antonyms": [
        "可以"
      ]
    },
